<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Champion Int'l raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Champion Int'l raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities upgraded Champion International Corp to strong buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said believes new management team will take a more dramatic approach to improving shareholder value.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $17.</p>
<p>-- said has identified $2.5 billion of assets &quot;which might be potential sale candidates with proceeds likely to be used for share repurchases, dividend increases, debt repayment and acquisitions.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Champion gained 3-1/8 to 52-1/4.</p>
</text>
